{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/extras/f4eda11bb2de1d2ea4a7eeb29235b774.avif?t=1771779227\" width=383 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player character&quot;P-PAN&quot;can fly at any time, so even if you're not good at jumping, don't worry. There are no difficult command inputs or complex switching controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies with punches, collect P Points, and use special moves whenever you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat this process to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/extras/a776ac36c0faa015719508179cace428.avif?t=1771779227\" alt=\"Prize (white box with red ribbon)\" width=115 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the boss at the end of each stage within the time limit to receive a prize!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the prizes are many of P-Pan's most treasured items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help P-Pan restore now-empty house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-STORY-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P-Pan lives peacefully on Panchu Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a mysterious giant robot suddenly steals everything from P-pan's house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P-Pan sets out on an adventure to retrieve precious possessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>***</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/extras/066266e81076e0dbc3dd350f0da55f6d.avif?t=1771779227\" width=384 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P-PAN's special skills are smiling face and endless punches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun progressing through the game with rapid-fire punches that can be shooted while walking or flying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(You can shoot in up to three directions with Power-Up Milk.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- The hot invincible item, &quot;Spicy Cheese&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/extras/b124339f1a950b1dd0a0258534e78a3d.avif?t=1771779227\" alt=\"Spicy Cheese (orange cheese cut into triangles and garnished with chili peppers)\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting this item will make you invincible for a certain period of time and allow you to unleash a fiery punch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It appears frequently throughout the stage, so use it as much as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Accumulate &quot;P Points&quot; dropped by enemies to unleash two cool &quot;Special Move.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/extras/68f2059e29ae6be3a56cf0d01c2cdd83.avif?t=1771779227\" alt=\"P-Pan fires his special move &quot;P Cannon&quot; straight from both hands.\" width=384 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat multiple enemies at once whenever you want. It's great for when you're in a pinch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Defeat bosses within the target time to earn a prize!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also prizes hidden throughout the stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Collection,&quot; you can open prize boxes obtained by clearing stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect them all and restore P-Pan's house to its original state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Colorful pixelated maps and original background music. A variety of stages that can be enjoyed even in a short space of time!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 stages in total + 1 bonus stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of stages are featured, from basic side-scrolling action to river rafting, snowboarding, and vertical-scrolling shooter-style stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage and boss has original background music! Boss battles are incredibly exciting! Aim for a complete clear!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891080?t=1771779227","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891080?t=1771779227","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/bc9526c959bf80211ba3e5ab70454fa4f3e22c00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771779227","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/bc9526c959bf80211ba3e5ab70454fa4f3e22c00/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771779227","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4370850,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/extras/f4eda11bb2de1d2ea4a7eeb29235b774.avif?t=1771779227\" width=383 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player character&quot;P-PAN&quot;can fly at any time, so even if you're not good at jumping, don't worry. There are no difficult command inputs or complex switching controls.</p><p 